{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_title", "source_sha256": "0c6f676791475616d5da3a21a25a5b0fa75337593a463532343b4aa93bb04ecf", "ja": "祈りの手をほどいて", "zh": "放开祈祷的双手", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2ffa0b46fe36d499fe51595611898e1a20d1041ef3a56d046659d681eed39480", "ja": "海美と育に仲良くなってほしいと無邪気に\n願うあずさを心配そうに見守る琴葉と麗花。\nだが放課後、あずさの元に静香がやってきて\n「海美の気持ちを考えてほしい」と言われ、\nあずさは言葉が足りなかった事に気づく。", "zh": "琴叶和丽花担心地守望着天真地希望海美和育能友好相处的梓。  \n然而放学后，静香来到梓身边，对她说：“希望你考虑一下海美的感受。”  \n梓这才意识到，自己有些话没有说清楚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1000_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "d6151a462f34b08f7b5c85a0d9d5cbbc3e58e2cadac11820637999a7ef78f8c7", "ja": "あら、海美ちゃんだわ。あっちは、1年生の……。\nもしかして、育ちゃんに会いに？", "zh": "哎呀，是海美呀。那边是1年级的……\n难道是来找育的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "b97df9ccdbb5bf3809b612fbff5d894c6bbf73645071fbcb44fb972ac5f5f61d", "ja": "手に、何か持っているみたいだけど……プレゼント\nかしら。まぁ、さっそく仲良くなったのね。ふふっ♪", "zh": "她手里好像拿着什么……是礼物吗？看来这么快就交到好朋友了呢。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "bdf32a743c43440b32e046cdda0175482979463b9c2123dd000823479ea48bbb", "ja": "海美さんが手に持っているもの、私には\nオモチャのヘビに見えるんだけど……。", "zh": "海美小姐手里拿的东西，在我看来像是玩具蛇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "576915923f04b1a6cdfa64eda7fddfe28097386055bbe81ab9363c3bcb2f00c7", "ja": "でも、出会いというものは意外なところに転がっている\nから……オモチャのヘビで、仲良くなれるのかも？", "zh": "不过，相遇这种事往往就发生在意想不到的地方……说不定靠玩具蛇也能和她成为好朋友呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "d7c484ca284be316a81c97651b4fe32ceab0d75da4c3c48710a2479e2f57f367", "ja": "私なんて、お昼寝していただけなのに。とっても\nかわいい妹がふたりもできましたから♪", "zh": "我明明只是在睡午觉，却有了两个特别可爱的妹妹♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "35ac8cdb163de391664407898a1f4a787e919a43127e425111578f87849c843f", "ja": "ミス・ローズのところは美希さんと星梨花さんがいて、\n安泰ね。静香にも、いい妹ができると良いのだけれど。", "zh": "米丝·萝丝那边有美希和星梨花在，真让人放心呢。要是静香也能有个好妹妹就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "f473fa26016dbfa9edcb63f3f8cf74deed289e6f597548d39469cc62e1e9b4bf", "ja": "そういえば、会長のところは、海美ちゃんが自分で\n選んだ妹じゃないんでしょう？　いいんですか？", "zh": "说起来，会长那边的妹妹，不是海美自己选的吧？这样真的没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "43ee7469c2b41a2530c5a298eebb58195798b610a1ac28397090ba62a47e94e7", "ja": "そうね。でも、とってもいい子たちだし……もしも\n嫌だったら、言ってくれるんじゃないかしら。", "zh": "是啊。不过她们都是非常好的孩子……要是不愿意的话，应该会跟我说的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "dc1acf58ab5cc151d3b0bc7118a3d8da04b11f14adec3f4463071cd28de0f3c7", "ja": "私は海美ちゃんのことも、育ちゃんのことも、\n信じているもの。", "zh": "我相信海美，也相信育。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "d9b674042b0c7a3441ed061dfa43056ac308f8fc3fe517e638303b004e1c91c6", "ja": "……これは、海美ちゃんの\n苦労がしのばれますわね。", "zh": "……这下不难想象海美吃了多少苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "ade0cdc2123e2d4caa60270344bf1094a0b021cba1f434b7cf80ec8b71e88979", "ja": "姉妹には、それぞれの姉妹なりの形があるとは思うけど\n……こればっかりは、そうかもしれないわね。", "zh": "虽然我觉得姐妹之间各有各的相处模式……\n但唯独这件事情上，可能确实是那样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1012_null", "source_sha256": "f15646b13b9f99fca4055ea9f9c4e7c45f92d5400293db167ef0ac2ecf5690da", "ja": "放課後……", "zh": "放学后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "331e6a9d6d71cdcc5fedeac37209c9e71e0604653ca932c7efeb940561214043", "ja": "ま、待ってください！", "zh": "请、请等一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "1320385e4257bad3b6db4f3d0240a4cad6dc44539d493546cf8a3c510748d54c", "ja": "いいえ、待てないわ！\n……失礼します！", "zh": "不，我等不了了！\n……告辞了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1015_se", "source_sha256": "ca1bb861cd7ac91e1d1642d22016a45edc150633af952bdade736af5f0946b1e", "ja": "ガラッ", "zh": "哗啦", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1016_010azu", "source_sha256": "c9aba744bf0be7c95a0f0e3e053bfe3d548f6803b5a1a142c1a28381e07c4a3e", "ja": "あ、あらあら？　育ちゃんと……\nあなたは、ミス・ロータスの妹の……。", "zh": "啊，哎呀呀？育酱和……\n你是米斯特·罗塔斯的妹妹……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "cfbbfa87c9e79d1299642223c76cece9e9cc009ffd4ccdd20e45f34a9d1a9238", "ja": "最上静香です。……ミス・ラベンダー！\n海美の友人として、今回のことは許せません！", "zh": "最上静香。……薰衣草小姐！\n作为海美的朋友，我绝不能原谅这次的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "68be16e0263c96c2a4ade8209ae7fe6c425467526aaf4198019bb01ea62590d1", "ja": "貴女は、海美のことを\n何だと思っているんですか！？", "zh": "您把海美当成什么了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1019_010azu", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "24595e3b303590551b584e35476dc7b1893776b7af6c5ab92a1aa52ef46ba3f0", "ja": "事情は、転校生さんに聞きました。\nふたりに仲良くしてほしい、と言ったそうですね……。", "zh": "我已经听转校生同学说过事情的经过了。\n听说您还说过，希望你们两个人能好好相处……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "07003bd948d43cf1e783314c0c9d84570d4b4dc9b62c025c2e6b35db274bdefc", "ja": "海美が貴女を慕う気持ち、知らないとは\n言わせません！　あんまりじゃないですか！", "zh": "我不允许你说不知道海美仰慕你的心情！这也太过分了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1023_010azu", "source_sha256": "6336b8c6ebc242e96ef2b07e20b1b29bf111b6dc01aca3232937829995f99822", "ja": "育ちゃん。育ちゃんにとっても、海美ちゃんと\n仲良くして欲しいというのは、負担だったかしら……？", "zh": "育。对你来说，我希望你能和海美好好相处这件事……是不是也让你觉得有负担了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1024_030iku", "source_sha256": "ef83404d0151236552bc16c7d5e416917df314361f0d60bee8d663226389b176", "ja": "う、ううん。負担とかは、ないけど……でも\n「どうしてわたしなんだろう？」とは、思ったかも。", "zh": "不、不是。倒没有觉得负担……不过，我可能也想过：“为什么是我呢？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1025_030iku", "source_sha256": "2f061ba5775a607b0e0467af25d6c034aac7de0d019c105fe5b2f0f93c9035e8", "ja": "それがわからないから、わたし、高坂さんのこと\n知りたいと思ったんだけど……。", "zh": "正因为不知道，所以我才想了解高坂同学……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "67532ff88f7a048b79ec3f1e7a1cd6cfc08d80cf2a90d3817cf3a34391d75191", "ja": "転入以来、貴女とたくさん話をしていたはずの中谷さん\nでさえ、こうなのに……海美の不安が、わかりますか？", "zh": "就连自转学以来应该和您说过很多话的中谷同学都这样……您能理解海美的不安吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1027_010azu", "source_sha256": "13449702b084c6c53c01cf404b6e7e3d2160588801b144a51772a1f90c2c6412", "ja": "ふたりに仲良くしてほしいというのは、私の本心で……\n心からの願いだったのだけど……。", "zh": "我是真心希望你们两个人能好好相处……\n这是发自内心的愿望……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1028_030iku", "source_sha256": "7c24cd9abf2a35a3c71fa54e6e7bd9dbd292a1cd69bb7535b9e0c4d9662c8547", "ja": "うん……でもやっぱり、\nわたしはあずさお姉ちゃんじゃないから。", "zh": "嗯……但说到底，\n我并不是梓姐姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1029_030iku", "source_sha256": "b124fb963cc24148f9b26960ea516ee784cb41ee8440ffa4e015fbab198355b7", "ja": "人の気持ちを、勝手に\n決めちゃうのはよくないと思う。", "zh": "我觉得，擅自替别人决定心情是不好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1030_010azu", "source_sha256": "e58668754824afc0a127c18c22702abe8495e782a3e2e32e3485a7d274b5d59a", "ja": "……そうね。特別言葉にしなくても、\nわかってくれるだなんて……。", "zh": "……是啊。即使不特意说出口，\n也觉得对方会明白什么的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1031_010azu", "source_sha256": "d8b99ffb0ea883b042742ce3c2ca8c68b061ffa81d4e08bddd11834dbaabe186", "ja": "私、海美ちゃんにとっても甘えていたんだわ……。\nあの子に、謝らなくちゃ……。", "zh": "我对海美撒娇撒得太过分了……\n得去跟那孩子道个歉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "c2866cd9602995b24329d95e5df7f6a7fcf7f5d10c0178ea2d05e26c071de65c", "ja": "あのっ……そういうことなら、お手伝いします。\n友達として、海美のこと、放っておけませんから！", "zh": "那个……要是这样的话，我来帮忙。\n毕竟作为朋友，我也不能对海美不管不顾！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1033_010azu", "source_sha256": "9f59ea9a59e6c9a866847dabff8c4760aa40c4ed44644e11ac24e044de42d8ad", "ja": "それから、たくさんの人の協力があって。\n私は改めて、海美ちゃんとお話することができた……。", "zh": "之后，在许多人的帮助下，我终于又能和海美酱好好谈一谈了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_09_1034_010azu", "source_sha256": "5d453e441af026fdaa23922b0cd13cb2fea0fe5dd2a49a9130a2ad95419970d8", "ja": "海美ちゃん、泣かせてしまってごめんなさい。\nあなたはとても大切な、私の……。", "zh": "海美，对不起，害你哭了。\n你是非常重要的、我的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
